iendly side offers varied seating and flexible surfaces for collaborative study.","evidence_claim":"Lehigh Libraries designates FML’s south side for conversation-friendly activity and lists movable tables and chairs, soft seating, group beehives, and mobile whiteboards.","source_url":"https://library.lehigh.edu/space/open-spaces","source_title":"Open Spaces | Lehigh University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The open seating is not reservable and follows Fairchild-Martindale Library hours; select the north side instead when quiet is required.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lehigh-lts-circle","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"LTS CIRCLE","title":"Study Among Curated Books and Art","subtitle":"A flexible community-centered space inside FML","notes":"Use the flexible furnishings for reading or discussion, but check for scheduled programs because the room can be reserved for eligible events.","short_summary":"The CIRCLE blends study seating, curated materials, art, and digital displays in a flexible library environment.","evidence_claim":"Lehigh states that the LTS CIRCLE is an FML space where students, faculty, and staff can study or relax among curated books, periodicals, movies, art, and display panels.","source_url":"https://library.lehigh.edu/news/lehigh-celebrates-grand-opening-lts-circle-fml","source_title":"Lehigh celebrates grand opening of the LTS CIRCLE at FML | Lehigh University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-02-20","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in FML’s southeast corner beside The Grind; open study use may yield to reserved programs and follows current library access rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lehigh-butz-pla